This setting of the 155CA is centered on 21.150 MHz
for CW operation.  It has a 2:1 VSWR band-width of
400 KHz centered on 21.150.  Maximum gain is 7.5 dBd
and maximum F/B is 25 dB.

Beta rod length= 11.625 inches (measured from tubing
center to inside edge of clamp).  Pigtail length= 7
inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-86 (voltage type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in October
1990.  9-20-91  RC

